[{"id":"zalama-37-22-2","words":["verb:zalama"],"options":[{"bs":"nanijeli su nepravdu","en":"they wronged"},{"bs":"nanosi nepravdu","en":"he/it wrongs"},{"bs":"da im nanese nepravdu","en":"so that he/it may wrong them"},{"bs":"nanijeli ste nepravdu","en":"you (all) wronged"}],"ref":"37:22","answerWord":"ظَلَمُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/83b16140c2088f8cf1bf.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"(And it is said unto the angels): Assemble those who did wrong, together with their wives and what they used to worship","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učiniti nepravdu, griješiti","en":"to wrong, to do injustice"},"passage":["ٱحْشُرُوا۟","ٱلَّذِينَ","ظَلَمُوا۟","وَأَزْوَٰجَهُمْ","وَمَا","كَانُوا۟","يَعْبُدُونَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"ظَلَمَ"}},{"id":"zalama-7-177-8","words":["verb:zalama"],"options":[{"bs":"čine nepravdu","en":"they wrong"},{"bs":"nanijeli ste nepravdu","en":"you (all) wronged"},{"bs":"nanio ti je nepravdu","en":"he/it wronged you"},{"bs":"nanijeli su nepravdu","en":"they wronged"}],"ref":"7:177","answerWord":"يَظْلِمُونَ","answerSound":"audio/f60931b2e36c2705641a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Evil as an example are the folk who denied Our revelations, and were wont to wrong themselves.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učiniti nepravdu, griješiti","en":"to wrong, to do injustice"},"passage":["سَآءَ","مَثَلًا","ٱلْقَوْمُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَذَّبُوا۟","بِـَٔايَٰتِنَا","وَأَنفُسَهُمْ","كَانُوا۟","يَظْلِمُونَ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"ظَلَمَ"}},{"id":"zalama-27-11-2","words":["verb:zalama"],"options":[{"bs":"nanio je nepravdu","en":"he/it wronged"},{"bs":"nanijeli ste nepravdu","en":"you (all) wronged"},{"bs":"nanio im je nepravdu","en":"he/it wronged them"},{"bs":"učinili smo im nepravdu","en":"We wronged them"}],"ref":"27:11","answerWord":"ظَلَمَ","answerSound":"audio/b174e43507c53723630b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Save him who hath done wrong and afterward hath changed evil for good. And lo! I am Forgiving, Merciful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učiniti nepravdu, griješiti","en":"to wrong, to do injustice"},"passage":["إِلَّا","مَن","ظَلَمَ","ثُمَّ","بَدَّلَ","حُسْنًۢا","بَعْدَ","سُوٓءٍ","فَإِنِّى","غَفُورٌ","رَّحِيمٌ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"ظَلَمَ"}},{"id":"zalama-2-272-27","words":["verb:zalama"],"options":[{"bs":"nanosi vam se nepravda","en":"you (all) are wronged"},{"bs":"nanio je nepravdu","en":"he/it wronged"},{"bs":"nanijeli su nam nepravdu","en":"they wronged us"},{"bs":"nanijeli su nepravdu","en":"they wronged"}],"ref":"2:272","answerWord":"تُظْلَمُونَ","answerSound":"audio/8c579c3b60dfb0b9b329.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"The guiding of them is not thy duty (O Muhammad), but Allah guideth whom He will. And whatsoever good thing ye spend, it is for yourselves, when ye spend not save in search of Allah's Countenance; and whatsoever good thing ye spend, it will be repaid to you in full, and ye will not be wronged.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učiniti nepravdu, griješiti","en":"to wrong, to do injustice"},"passage":["لَّيْسَ","عَلَيْكَ","هُدَىٰهُمْ","وَلَٰكِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","يَهْدِى","مَن","يَشَآءُ","وَمَا","تُنفِقُوا۟","مِنْ","خَيْرٍ","فَلِأَنفُسِكُمْ","وَمَا","تُنفِقُونَ","إِلَّا","ٱبْتِغَآءَ","وَجْهِ","ٱللَّهِ","وَمَا","تُنفِقُوا۟","مِنْ","خَيْرٍ","يُوَفَّ","إِلَيْكُمْ","وَأَنتُمْ","لَا","تُظْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[27],"facts":{"verb":"ظَلَمَ"}},{"id":"zalama-4-40-3","words":["verb:zalama"],"options":[{"bs":"nanosi nepravdu","en":"he/it wrongs"},{"bs":"čine nepravdu","en":"they wrong"},{"bs":"nanio im je nepravdu","en":"he/it wronged them"},{"bs":"nanosite nepravdu","en":"you (all) wrong"}],"ref":"4:40","answerWord":"يَظْلِمُ","answerSound":"audio/5a4225bab6bc159b9a86.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! Allah wrongeth not even of the weight of an ant; and if there is a good deed, He will double it and will give (the doer) from His presence an immense reward.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učiniti nepravdu, griješiti","en":"to wrong, to do injustice"},"passage":["إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","لَا","يَظْلِمُ","مِثْقَالَ","ذَرَّةٍ","وَإِن","تَكُ","حَسَنَةً","يُضَٰعِفْهَا","وَيُؤْتِ","مِن","لَّدُنْهُ","أَجْرًا","عَظِيمًا"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"ظَلَمَ"}},{"id":"zalama-9-70-21","words":["verb:zalama"],"options":[{"bs":"da im nanese nepravdu","en":"so that he/it may wrong them"},{"bs":"nanosi nepravdu","en":"he/it wrongs"},{"bs":"nanijeli ste nepravdu","en":"you (all) wronged"},{"bs":"nanio sam nepravdu","en":"I wronged"}],"ref":"9:70","answerWord":"لِيَظْلِمَهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/4eab0363dd2e73daa18b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Hath not the fame of those before them reached them - the folk of Noah, A'ad, Thamud, the folk of Abraham, the dwellers of Midian and the disasters (which befell them)? Their messengers (from Allah) came unto them with proofs (of Allah's Sovereignty). So Allah surely wronged them not, but they did wrong themselves.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učiniti nepravdu, griješiti","en":"to wrong, to do injustice"},"passage":["أَلَمْ","يَأْتِهِمْ","نَبَأُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","مِن","قَبْلِهِمْ","قَوْمِ","نُوحٍ","وَعَادٍ","وَثَمُودَ","وَقَوْمِ","إِبْرَٰهِيمَ","وَأَصْحَٰبِ","مَدْيَنَ","وَٱلْمُؤْتَفِكَٰتِ","أَتَتْهُمْ","رُسُلُهُم","بِٱلْبَيِّنَٰتِ","فَمَا","كَانَ","ٱللَّهُ","لِيَظْلِمَهُمْ","وَلَٰكِن","كَانُوٓا۟","أَنفُسَهُمْ","يَظْلِمُونَ"],"marked":[21],"facts":{"verb":"ظَلَمَ"}},{"id":"zalama-43-76-1","words":["verb:zalama"],"options":[{"bs":"učinili smo im nepravdu","en":"We wronged them"},{"bs":"čine nepravdu","en":"they wrong"},{"bs":"nanijeli ste nepravdu","en":"you (all) wronged"},{"bs":"pa su nanijeli nepravdu","en":"so they wronged"}],"ref":"43:76","answerWord":"ظَلَمْنَٰهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/78392f937ec2d816b336.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"We wronged them not, but they it was who did the wrong.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učiniti nepravdu, griješiti","en":"to wrong, to do injustice"},"passage":["وَمَا","ظَلَمْنَٰهُمْ","وَلَٰكِن","كَانُوا۟","هُمُ","ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"ظَلَمَ"}},{"id":"zalama-16-41-7","words":["verb:zalama"],"options":[{"bs":"nanesena im je nepravda","en":"they were wronged"},{"bs":"nanosite nepravdu","en":"you (all) wrong"},{"bs":"da im nanese nepravdu","en":"so that he/it may wrong them"},{"bs":"nanijela je nepravdu","en":"she/it wronged"}],"ref":"16:41","answerWord":"ظُلِمُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/9792762a50b7ce288c41.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And those who became fugitives for the cause of Allah after they had been oppressed, We verily shall give them goodly lodging in the world, and surely the reward of the Hereafter is greater, if they but knew;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učiniti nepravdu, griješiti","en":"to wrong, to do injustice"},"passage":["وَٱلَّذِينَ","هَاجَرُوا۟","فِى","ٱللَّهِ","مِنۢ","بَعْدِ","مَا","ظُلِمُوا۟","لَنُبَوِّئَنَّهُمْ","فِى","ٱلدُّنْيَا","حَسَنَةً","وَلَأَجْرُ","ٱلْءَاخِرَةِ","أَكْبَرُ","لَوْ","كَانُوا۟","يَعْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"ظَلَمَ"}},{"id":"zalama-2-57-13","words":["verb:zalama"],"options":[{"bs":"nanijeli su nam nepravdu","en":"they wronged us"},{"bs":"i nanijeli su nepravdu","en":"and they wronged"},{"bs":"nanesena im je nepravda","en":"they were wronged"},{"bs":"učinili smo im nepravdu","en":"We wronged them"}],"ref":"2:57","answerWord":"ظَلَمُونَا","answerSound":"audio/89fe42f436c16daa4d7f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And We caused the white cloud to overshadow you and sent down on you the manna and the quails, (saying): Eat of the good things wherewith We have provided you - they wronged Us not, but they did wrong themselves.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učiniti nepravdu, griješiti","en":"to wrong, to do injustice"},"passage":["وَظَلَّلْنَا","عَلَيْكُمُ","ٱلْغَمَامَ","وَأَنزَلْنَا","عَلَيْكُمُ","ٱلْمَنَّ","وَٱلسَّلْوَىٰ","كُلُوا۟","مِن","طَيِّبَٰتِ","مَا","رَزَقْنَٰكُمْ","وَمَا","ظَلَمُونَا","وَلَٰكِن","كَانُوٓا۟","أَنفُسَهُمْ","يَظْلِمُونَ"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"ظَلَمَ"}},{"id":"zalama-3-117-18","words":["verb:zalama"],"options":[{"bs":"nanio im je nepravdu","en":"he/it wronged them"},{"bs":"i nanijeli su nepravdu","en":"and they wronged"},{"bs":"nanijeli ste nepravdu","en":"you (all) wronged"},{"bs":"nanosi nepravdu","en":"he/it wrongs"}],"ref":"3:117","answerWord":"ظَلَمَهُمُ","answerSound":"audio/be2b2918126f6dbb58a3.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"The likeness of that which they spend in this life of the world is as the likeness of a biting, icy wind which smiteth the harvest of a people who have wronged themselves, and devastateth it. Allah wronged them not, but they do wrong themselves.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učiniti nepravdu, griješiti","en":"to wrong, to do injustice"},"passage":["مَثَلُ","مَا","يُنفِقُونَ","فِى","هَٰذِهِ","ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","ٱلدُّنْيَا","كَمَثَلِ","رِيحٍ","فِيهَا","صِرٌّ","أَصَابَتْ","حَرْثَ","قَوْمٍ","ظَلَمُوٓا۟","أَنفُسَهُمْ","فَأَهْلَكَتْهُ","وَمَا","ظَلَمَهُمُ","ٱللَّهُ","وَلَٰكِنْ","أَنفُسَهُمْ","يَظْلِمُونَ"],"marked":[18],"facts":{"verb":"ظَلَمَ"}},{"id":"zalama-7-103-9","words":["verb:zalama"],"options":[{"bs":"pa su nanijeli nepravdu","en":"so they wronged"},{"bs":"nanosite nepravdu","en":"you (all) wrong"},{"bs":"učinili smo im nepravdu","en":"We wronged them"},{"bs":"nanosi vam se nepravda","en":"you (all) are wronged"}],"ref":"7:103","answerWord":"فَظَلَمُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/0200a519ab20954d50f4.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Then, after them, We sent Moses with our tokens unto Pharaoh and his chiefs, but they repelled them. Now, see the nature of the consequence for the corrupters!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učiniti nepravdu, griješiti","en":"to wrong, to do injustice"},"passage":["ثُمَّ","بَعَثْنَا","مِنۢ","بَعْدِهِم","مُّوسَىٰ","بِـَٔايَٰتِنَآ","إِلَىٰ","فِرْعَوْنَ","وَمَلَإِي۟هِۦ","فَظَلَمُوا۟","بِهَا","فَٱنظُرْ","كَيْفَ","كَانَ","عَٰقِبَةُ","ٱلْمُفْسِدِينَ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"ظَلَمَ"}},{"id":"zalama-27-44-20","words":["verb:zalama"],"options":[{"bs":"nanio sam nepravdu","en":"I wronged"},{"bs":"nanosite nepravdu","en":"you (all) wrong"},{"bs":"da im nanese nepravdu","en":"so that he/it may wrong them"},{"bs":"nanio je nepravdu","en":"he/it wronged"}],"ref":"27:44","answerWord":"ظَلَمْتُ","answerSound":"audio/503ab8666106cef714a7.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"It was said unto her: Enter the hall. And when she saw it she deemed it a pool and bared her legs. (Solomon) said: Lo! it is a hall, made smooth, of glass. She said: My Lord! Lo! I have wronged myself, and I surrender with Solomon unto Allah, the Lord of the Worlds.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učiniti nepravdu, griješiti","en":"to wrong, to do injustice"},"passage":["قِيلَ","لَهَا","ٱدْخُلِى","ٱلصَّرْحَ","فَلَمَّا","رَأَتْهُ","حَسِبَتْهُ","لُجَّةً","وَكَشَفَتْ","عَن","سَاقَيْهَا","قَالَ","إِنَّهُۥ","صَرْحٌ","مُّمَرَّدٌ","مِّن","قَوَارِيرَ","قَالَتْ","رَبِّ","إِنِّى","ظَلَمْتُ","نَفْسِى","وَأَسْلَمْتُ","مَعَ","سُلَيْمَٰنَ","لِلَّهِ","رَبِّ","ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ"],"marked":[20],"facts":{"verb":"ظَلَمَ"}},{"id":"zalama-2-54-6","words":["verb:zalama"],"options":[{"bs":"nanijeli ste nepravdu","en":"you (all) wronged"},{"bs":"nanio im je nepravdu","en":"he/it wronged them"},{"bs":"nanosite nepravdu","en":"you (all) wrong"},{"bs":"čine nepravdu","en":"they wrong"}],"ref":"2:54","answerWord":"ظَلَمْتُمْ","answerSound":"audio/cec51657a6c3fe5607e5.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when Moses said unto his people: O my people! Ye have wronged yourselves by your choosing of the calf (for worship) so turn in penitence to your Creator, and kill (the guilty) yourselves. That will be best for you with your Creator and He will relent toward you. Lo! He is the Relenting, the Merciful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učiniti nepravdu, griješiti","en":"to wrong, to do injustice"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","قَالَ","مُوسَىٰ","لِقَوْمِهِۦ","يَٰقَوْمِ","إِنَّكُمْ","ظَلَمْتُمْ","أَنفُسَكُم","بِٱتِّخَاذِكُمُ","ٱلْعِجْلَ","فَتُوبُوٓا۟","إِلَىٰ","بَارِئِكُمْ","فَٱقْتُلُوٓا۟","أَنفُسَكُمْ","ذَٰلِكُمْ","خَيْرٌ","لَّكُمْ","عِندَ","بَارِئِكُمْ","فَتَابَ","عَلَيْكُمْ","إِنَّهُۥ","هُوَ","ٱلتَّوَّابُ","ٱلرَّحِيمُ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"ظَلَمَ"}},{"id":"zalama-2-279-14","words":["verb:zalama"],"options":[{"bs":"nanosite nepravdu","en":"you (all) wrong"},{"bs":"nanio im je nepravdu","en":"he/it wronged them"},{"bs":"nanijeli ste nepravdu","en":"you (all) wronged"},{"bs":"učinjena mu je nepravda","en":"he/it was wronged"}],"ref":"2:279","answerWord":"تَظْلِمُونَ","answerSound":"audio/f41da4467245bd97bb07.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And if ye do not, then be warned of war (against you) from Allah and His messenger. And if ye repent, then ye have your principal (without interest). Wrong not, and ye shall not be wronged.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učiniti nepravdu, griješiti","en":"to wrong, to do injustice"},"passage":["فَإِن","لَّمْ","تَفْعَلُوا۟","فَأْذَنُوا۟","بِحَرْبٍ","مِّنَ","ٱللَّهِ","وَرَسُولِهِۦ","وَإِن","تُبْتُمْ","فَلَكُمْ","رُءُوسُ","أَمْوَٰلِكُمْ","لَا","تَظْلِمُونَ","وَلَا","تُظْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[14],"facts":{"verb":"ظَلَمَ"}},{"id":"zalama-4-64-11","words":["verb:zalama"],"options":[{"bs":"nanijeli su nepravdu","en":"they wronged"},{"bs":"nanijela je nepravdu","en":"she/it wronged"},{"bs":"nanosite nepravdu","en":"you (all) wrong"},{"bs":"nanosi nepravdu","en":"he/it wrongs"}],"ref":"4:64","answerWord":"ظَّلَمُوٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/d9fab42880337c73c488.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"We sent no messenger save that he should be obeyed by Allah's leave. And if, when they had wronged themselves, they had but come unto thee and asked forgiveness of Allah, and asked forgiveness of the messenger, they would have found Allah Forgiving, Merciful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učiniti nepravdu, griješiti","en":"to wrong, to do injustice"},"passage":["وَمَآ","أَرْسَلْنَا","مِن","رَّسُولٍ","إِلَّا","لِيُطَاعَ","بِإِذْنِ","ٱللَّهِ","وَلَوْ","أَنَّهُمْ","إِذ","ظَّلَمُوٓا۟","أَنفُسَهُمْ","جَآءُوكَ","فَٱسْتَغْفَرُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","وَٱسْتَغْفَرَ","لَهُمُ","ٱلرَّسُولُ","لَوَجَدُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","تَوَّابًا","رَّحِيمًا"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"ظَلَمَ"}},{"id":"zalama-4-110-4","words":["verb:zalama"],"options":[{"bs":"nanosi nepravdu","en":"he/it wrongs"},{"bs":"nanosite nepravdu","en":"you (all) wrong"},{"bs":"nanosi vam se nepravda","en":"you (all) are wronged"},{"bs":"nanijeli smo nepravdu","en":"we wronged"}],"ref":"4:110","answerWord":"يَظْلِمْ","answerSound":"audio/2322e1e4f376da5fcee2.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Yet whoso doeth evil or wrongeth his own soul, then seeketh pardon of Allah, will find Allah Forgiving, Merciful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učiniti nepravdu, griješiti","en":"to wrong, to do injustice"},"passage":["وَمَن","يَعْمَلْ","سُوٓءًا","أَوْ","يَظْلِمْ","نَفْسَهُۥ","ثُمَّ","يَسْتَغْفِرِ","ٱللَّهَ","يَجِدِ","ٱللَّهَ","غَفُورًا","رَّحِيمًا"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"ظَلَمَ"}},{"id":"zalama-4-148-9","words":["verb:zalama"],"options":[{"bs":"učinjena mu je nepravda","en":"he/it was wronged"},{"bs":"čine nepravdu","en":"they wrong"},{"bs":"pa su nanijeli nepravdu","en":"so they wronged"},{"bs":"nanio im je nepravdu","en":"he/it wronged them"}],"ref":"4:148","answerWord":"ظُلِمَ","answerSound":"audio/dcaf53b45d9526f46788.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Allah loveth not the utterance of harsh speech save by one who hath been wronged. Allah is ever Hearer, Knower.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učiniti nepravdu, griješiti","en":"to wrong, to do injustice"},"passage":["لَّا","يُحِبُّ","ٱللَّهُ","ٱلْجَهْرَ","بِٱلسُّوٓءِ","مِنَ","ٱلْقَوْلِ","إِلَّا","مَن","ظُلِمَ","وَكَانَ","ٱللَّهُ","سَمِيعًا","عَلِيمًا"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"ظَلَمَ"}},{"id":"zalama-4-168-3","words":["verb:zalama"],"options":[{"bs":"i nanijeli su nepravdu","en":"and they wronged"},{"bs":"nanosi nepravdu","en":"he/it wrongs"},{"bs":"nanio im je nepravdu","en":"he/it wronged them"},{"bs":"nanio ti je nepravdu","en":"he/it wronged you"}],"ref":"4:168","answerWord":"وَظَلَمُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/195542365dca086ba8d2.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! those who disbelieve and deal in wrong, Allah will never forgive them, neither will He guide them unto a road,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učiniti nepravdu, griješiti","en":"to wrong, to do injustice"},"passage":["إِنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوا۟","وَظَلَمُوا۟","لَمْ","يَكُنِ","ٱللَّهُ","لِيَغْفِرَ","لَهُمْ","وَلَا","لِيَهْدِيَهُمْ","طَرِيقًا"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"ظَلَمَ"}},{"id":"zalama-7-23-2","words":["verb:zalama"],"options":[{"bs":"nanijeli smo nepravdu","en":"we wronged"},{"bs":"nanijeli su nepravdu","en":"they wronged"},{"bs":"nanijela je nepravdu","en":"she/it wronged"},{"bs":"nanijeli ste nepravdu","en":"you (all) wronged"}],"ref":"7:23","answerWord":"ظَلَمْنَآ","answerSound":"audio/703a223e5688542db380.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They said: Our Lord! We have wronged ourselves. If thou forgive us not and have not mercy on us, surely we are of the lost!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učiniti nepravdu, griješiti","en":"to wrong, to do injustice"},"passage":["قَالَا","رَبَّنَا","ظَلَمْنَآ","أَنفُسَنَا","وَإِن","لَّمْ","تَغْفِرْ","لَنَا","وَتَرْحَمْنَا","لَنَكُونَنَّ","مِنَ","ٱلْخَٰسِرِينَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"ظَلَمَ"}},{"id":"zalama-10-54-4","words":["verb:zalama"],"options":[{"bs":"nanijela je nepravdu","en":"she/it wronged"},{"bs":"nanosi nepravdu","en":"he/it wrongs"},{"bs":"nanosite nepravdu","en":"you (all) wrong"},{"bs":"nanio sam nepravdu","en":"I wronged"}],"ref":"10:54","answerWord":"ظَلَمَتْ","answerSound":"audio/502378dc951c7737cf49.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And if each soul that doeth wrong had all that is in the earth it would seek to ransom itself therewith; and they will feel remorse within them, when they see the doom. But it hath been judged between them fairly and they are not wronged.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učiniti nepravdu, griješiti","en":"to wrong, to do injustice"},"passage":["وَلَوْ","أَنَّ","لِكُلِّ","نَفْسٍ","ظَلَمَتْ","مَا","فِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","لَٱفْتَدَتْ","بِهِۦ","وَأَسَرُّوا۟","ٱلنَّدَامَةَ","لَمَّا","رَأَوُا۟","ٱلْعَذَابَ","وَقُضِىَ","بَيْنَهُم","بِٱلْقِسْطِ","وَهُمْ","لَا","يُظْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"ظَلَمَ"}},{"id":"hajara-2-218-4","words":["verb:hajara"],"options":[{"bs":"iselili su se","en":"they emigrated"},{"bs":"iseljava se","en":"he/it emigrates"},{"bs":"iselio se","en":"he/it emigrated"},{"bs":"pa se iseljavate","en":"so you (all) emigrate"}],"ref":"2:218","answerWord":"هَاجَرُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/bfcc1536bdfd8197444e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! those who believe, and those who emigrate (to escape the persecution) and strive in the way of Allah, these have hope of Allah's mercy. Allah is Forgiving, Merciful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"iseliti se, preseliti se","en":"to emigrate"},"passage":["إِنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","وَٱلَّذِينَ","هَاجَرُوا۟","وَجَٰهَدُوا۟","فِى","سَبِيلِ","ٱللَّهِ","أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","يَرْجُونَ","رَحْمَتَ","ٱللَّهِ","وَٱللَّهُ","غَفُورٌ","رَّحِيمٌ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"هاجَرَ"}},{"id":"hajara-4-97-20","words":["verb:hajara"],"options":[{"bs":"pa se iseljavate","en":"so you (all) emigrate"},{"bs":"i iselili su se","en":"and they emigrated"},{"bs":"iselio se","en":"he/it emigrated"},{"bs":"iselile su se","en":"they emigrated"}],"ref":"4:97","answerWord":"فَتُهَاجِرُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/0c390ba4a6c891fb90fb.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! as for those whom the angels take (in death) while they wrong themselves, (the angels) will ask: In what were ye engaged? They will say: We were oppressed in the land. (The angels) will say: Was not Allah's earth spacious that ye could have migrated therein? As for such, their habitation will be hell, an evil journey's end;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"iseliti se, preseliti se","en":"to emigrate"},"passage":["إِنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","تَوَفَّىٰهُمُ","ٱلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةُ","ظَالِمِىٓ","أَنفُسِهِمْ","قَالُوا۟","فِيمَ","كُنتُمْ","قَالُوا۟","كُنَّا","مُسْتَضْعَفِينَ","فِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","قَالُوٓا۟","أَلَمْ","تَكُنْ","أَرْضُ","ٱللَّهِ","وَٰسِعَةً","فَتُهَاجِرُوا۟","فِيهَا","فَأُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","مَأْوَىٰهُمْ","جَهَنَّمُ","وَسَآءَتْ","مَصِيرًا"],"marked":[20],"facts":{"verb":"هاجَرَ"}},{"id":"istafa-3-33-2","words":["verb:istafa"],"options":[{"bs":"odabrao je","en":"he/it chose"},{"bs":"odabrali smo ga","en":"we chose him"},{"bs":"odabrao te je","en":"he/it chose you"},{"bs":"odabrali smo","en":"we chose"}],"ref":"3:33","answerWord":"ٱصْطَفَىٰٓ","answerSound":"audio/c9dbcaa159cd41ac8295.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! Allah preferred Adam and Noah and the Family of Abraham and the Family of 'Imran above (all His) creatures.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odabrati, izabrati","en":"to choose, to select"},"passage":["إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","ٱصْطَفَىٰٓ","ءَادَمَ","وَنُوحًا","وَءَالَ","إِبْرَٰهِيمَ","وَءَالَ","عِمْرَٰنَ","عَلَى","ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"اصْطَفَى"}},{"id":"istafa-2-130-10","words":["verb:istafa"],"options":[{"bs":"odabrali smo ga","en":"we chose him"},{"bs":"bira","en":"chooses"},{"bs":"odabrao sam te","en":"I chose you"},{"bs":"odabrali smo","en":"we chose"}],"ref":"2:130","answerWord":"ٱصْطَفَيْنَٰهُ","answerSound":"audio/18f928d2269d0a76bd5c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And who forsaketh the religion of Abraham save him who befooleth himself? Verily We chose him in the world, and lo! in the Hereafter he is among the righteous.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odabrati, izabrati","en":"to choose, to select"},"passage":["وَمَن","يَرْغَبُ","عَن","مِّلَّةِ","إِبْرَٰهِۦمَ","إِلَّا","مَن","سَفِهَ","نَفْسَهُۥ","وَلَقَدِ","ٱصْطَفَيْنَٰهُ","فِى","ٱلدُّنْيَا","وَإِنَّهُۥ","فِى","ٱلْءَاخِرَةِ","لَمِنَ","ٱلصَّٰلِحِينَ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"اصْطَفَى"}},{"id":"istafa-2-132-8","words":["verb:istafa"],"options":[{"bs":"odabrao je","en":"he/it chose"},{"bs":"odabrali smo","en":"we chose"},{"bs":"i odabrao te je","en":"and he/it chose you"},{"bs":"odabrao ga je","en":"he/it chose him"}],"ref":"2:132","answerWord":"ٱصْطَفَىٰ","answerSound":"audio/eb5fa900993aeb81c65a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"The same did Abraham enjoin upon his sons, and also Jacob, (saying): O my sons! Lo! Allah hath chosen for you the (true) religion; therefore die not save as men who have surrendered (unto Him).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odabrati, izabrati","en":"to choose, to select"},"passage":["وَوَصَّىٰ","بِهَآ","إِبْرَٰهِۦمُ","بَنِيهِ","وَيَعْقُوبُ","يَٰبَنِىَّ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","ٱصْطَفَىٰ","لَكُمُ","ٱلدِّينَ","فَلَا","تَمُوتُنَّ","إِلَّا","وَأَنتُم","مُّسْلِمُونَ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"اصْطَفَى"}},{"id":"istafa-3-42-6","words":["verb:istafa"],"options":[{"bs":"odabrao te je","en":"he/it chose you"},{"bs":"odabrali smo ga","en":"we chose him"},{"bs":"odabrao je","en":"he/it chose"},{"bs":"odabrao sam te","en":"I chose you"}],"ref":"3:42","answerWord":"ٱصْطَفَىٰكِ","answerSound":"audio/ae79ac0fa01f2bb8f8f0.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when the angels said: O Mary! Lo! Allah hath chosen thee and made thee pure, and hath preferred thee above (all) the women of creation.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odabrati, izabrati","en":"to choose, to select"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","قَالَتِ","ٱلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةُ","يَٰمَرْيَمُ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","ٱصْطَفَىٰكِ","وَطَهَّرَكِ","وَٱصْطَفَىٰكِ","عَلَىٰ","نِسَآءِ","ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"اصْطَفَى"}},{"id":"istafa-3-42-8","words":["verb:istafa"],"options":[{"bs":"i odabrao te je","en":"and he/it chose you"},{"bs":"odabrao ga je","en":"he/it chose him"},{"bs":"odabrao je","en":"he/it chose"},{"bs":"odabrao sam te","en":"I chose you"}],"ref":"3:42","answerWord":"وَٱصْطَفَىٰكِ","answerSound":"audio/10cb0c01aff7d35c0dd0.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when the angels said: O Mary! Lo! Allah hath chosen thee and made thee pure, and hath preferred thee above (all) the women of creation.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odabrati, izabrati","en":"to choose, to select"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","قَالَتِ","ٱلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةُ","يَٰمَرْيَمُ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","ٱصْطَفَىٰكِ","وَطَهَّرَكِ","وَٱصْطَفَىٰكِ","عَلَىٰ","نِسَآءِ","ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"اصْطَفَى"}},{"id":"istafa-7-144-3","words":["verb:istafa"],"options":[{"bs":"odabrao sam te","en":"I chose you"},{"bs":"odabrao te je","en":"he/it chose you"},{"bs":"odabrao je","en":"he/it chose"},{"bs":"bira","en":"chooses"}],"ref":"7:144","answerWord":"ٱصْطَفَيْتُكَ","answerSound":"audio/05c9b0434ee9dbc0d66d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: O Moses! I have preferred thee above mankind by My messages and by My speaking (unto thee). So hold that which I have given thee, and be among the thankful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odabrati, izabrati","en":"to choose, to select"},"passage":["قَالَ","يَٰمُوسَىٰٓ","إِنِّى","ٱصْطَفَيْتُكَ","عَلَى","ٱلنَّاسِ","بِرِسَٰلَٰتِى","وَبِكَلَٰمِى","فَخُذْ","مَآ","ءَاتَيْتُكَ","وَكُن","مِّنَ","ٱلشَّٰكِرِينَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"اصْطَفَى"}},{"id":"istafa-22-75-1","words":["verb:istafa"],"options":[{"bs":"bira","en":"chooses"},{"bs":"odabrao ga je","en":"he/it chose him"},{"bs":"odabrao sam te","en":"I chose you"},{"bs":"odabrao te je","en":"he/it chose you"}],"ref":"22:75","answerWord":"يَصْطَفِى","answerSound":"audio/9ef9542913391b8fbf1d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Allah chooseth from the angels messengers, and (also) from mankind. Lo! Allah is Hearer, Seer.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odabrati, izabrati","en":"to choose, to select"},"passage":["ٱللَّهُ","يَصْطَفِى","مِنَ","ٱلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةِ","رُسُلًا","وَمِنَ","ٱلنَّاسِ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","سَمِيعٌۢ","بَصِيرٌ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"اصْطَفَى"}},{"id":"istafa-35-32-4","words":["verb:istafa"],"options":[{"bs":"odabrali smo","en":"we chose"},{"bs":"odabrao je","en":"he/it chose"},{"bs":"odabrao te je","en":"he/it chose you"},{"bs":"odabrao ga je","en":"he/it chose him"}],"ref":"35:32","answerWord":"ٱصْطَفَيْنَا","answerSound":"audio/10eada9541826928f5e4.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Then We gave the Scripture as inheritance unto those whom We elected of Our bondmen. But of them are some who wrong themselves and of them are some who are lukewarm, and of them are some who outstrip (others) through good deeds, by Allah's leave. That is the great favour!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odabrati, izabrati","en":"to choose, to select"},"passage":["ثُمَّ","أَوْرَثْنَا","ٱلْكِتَٰبَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ٱصْطَفَيْنَا","مِنْ","عِبَادِنَا","فَمِنْهُمْ","ظَالِمٌ","لِّنَفْسِهِۦ","وَمِنْهُم","مُّقْتَصِدٌ","وَمِنْهُمْ","سَابِقٌۢ","بِٱلْخَيْرَٰتِ","بِإِذْنِ","ٱللَّهِ","ذَٰلِكَ","هُوَ","ٱلْفَضْلُ","ٱلْكَبِيرُ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"اصْطَفَى"}},{"id":"istafa-37-153-0","words":["verb:istafa"],"options":[{"bs":"zar je odabrao","en":"has He chosen"},{"bs":"odabrali smo","en":"we chose"},{"bs":"odabrali smo ga","en":"we chose him"},{"bs":"odabrao te je","en":"he/it chose you"}],"ref":"37:153","answerWord":"أَصْطَفَى","answerSound":"audio/a14285dd85a927b92903.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"(And again of their falsehood): He hath preferred daughters to sons.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odabrati, izabrati","en":"to choose, to select"},"passage":["أَصْطَفَى","ٱلْبَنَاتِ","عَلَى","ٱلْبَنِينَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"اصْطَفَى"}}]